# Project intentions

Read [docs/INTENTIONS.md](docs/INTENTIONS.md) before expanding scope.

## Stay in v1

Allowed: Grafana OSS image with the unsigned forecast plugin baked in, baselines worker image, umbrella Helm chart with the worker as a Grafana sidecar, existing Kafka/Druid URLs in values.

Do **not** add without updating INTENTIONS first:

- Plugin or worker source
- Kafka, ZooKeeper, or Druid
- Compose sandbox / TestData / demo dashboards
- Prometheus
- Grafana.com signing
- arm64
- Worker HTTP health endpoint
- A separate worker Deployment
